{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;IL13-Sonya E-Links&quot;</strong> is a 2D roguelite action game where you charge energy through enemy breaks, precise dodges, and parries to unleash powerful weapons and swiftly defeat incoming foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25bc <strong>Battle</strong><br>Break enemies with consecutive attacks and deliver a powerful <strong>finishing blow</strong>!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490920/extras/f9295a620794e88023053f74c940bc7d.poster.avif?t=1738471262\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490920/extras/f9295a620794e88023053f74c940bc7d.webm?t=1738471262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490920/extras/f9295a620794e88023053f74c940bc7d.mp4?t=1738471262\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy enemy projectiles and counterattack after perfect dodges to eliminate smaller foes while charging energy into the powerful weapons on your back!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490920/extras/54e85af67b8e390d3b78b9f15fa87d9a.poster.avif?t=1738471262\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490920/extras/54e85af67b8e390d3b78b9f15fa87d9a.webm?t=1738471262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490920/extras/54e85af67b8e390d3b78b9f15fa87d9a.mp4?t=1738471262\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\